1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,536
Careful with the words.

2
00:00:01,536 --> 00:00:05,195
A back cross is F one crossed with either parent.

3
00:00:05,195 --> 00:00:08,880
A test cross must use the homozygous recessive.

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:13,398
So every test cross is a back cross, but not the other way round.

